5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! Let's make this place super clean! I want to know how other people do it. I'll check the ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" and ""Supervised mornings on the next lane""!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I agree, harmony is important. I'd like to check the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" and ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs"" to see our current situation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're aiming for a solution that actually lasts, we need the facts. I'll look into the ""Ward complaint log for this point"" and ""Statements at the residents' meeting"" to see where we're really failing.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm looking forward to this! Let's make sure we don't just make a plan that looks good on paper. I'll check the ""Truck arrival time from the crew leader"" and ""Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.""","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that we need a practical solution. To ensure the burden is distributed fairly, I will look into the ""Measurements of the five frontages"" and ""The station block's meeting minutes.""","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I wonder if the other lanes have any secret tricks to keep things smelling fresh! @May, do you think the truck timing makes a big difference in how messy it gets?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That's a good question. If the trash sits out too long, it might cause more issues. I hope the financial data I'm looking into will help us find a sustainable way to manage the costs too.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It probably does, but timing is just a detail. The real issue is the friction between us. Let's focus on the root causes of the complaints so we don't just put a bandage on a wound.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, it definitely does! If the bags sit there all day, it's a disaster. But @Shunichi, ""details"" are exactly what make or break a plan. I'm more interested in the actual workload involved here.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, I agree. Workload and physical space are the primary factors. If we ignore the actual layout of our properties, we risk creating a plan that is ""equal"" in name but unfair in practice.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I want to know if the other lanes have a special way of doing things! @Asuka, do you think the station block has a cool design that we can copy to make it less smelly?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"A design that looks nice and stays clean would be wonderful. I just hope that whatever we choose is affordable for everyone involved, so no one feels burdened by the cost.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Design is a luxury, Midori. What we actually need is a system that doesn't make us hate each other. If the cost is too high or the rules too rigid, we're just inviting more arguments.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you're so dramatic! But you're right about the arguments. I just want to make sure we aren't accidentally signing up for a second job. Let's keep it simple and sustainable, shall we?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Simplicity is fine, but it shouldn't be a mask for inequality. If we simply ""keep it simple"" by leaving the point where it is, we aren't solving the problem; we're just ignoring the burden on one household.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll be the scout for the group! I'm going to find out all the secrets of the other blocks so we can pick the most fun and cleanest way to do this! Let's do our best!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we're all so motivated. I'll do my best to gather the financial details so we can make a decision that's fair and comfortable for every household. I'm looking forward to hearing what you all find!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's hope your ""secrets"" and ""financial details"" actually lead to a consensus. I'll be interested to see if the complaints are as predictable as I suspect. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'll be the one to keep things lively while we wait for the data! Let's just make sure we're honest about the effort required. See you all soon with the results!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will focus on the objective data. When we reconvene, I expect us to analyze the physical constraints and previous precedents carefully to ensure the final arrangement is truly equitable for everyone involved. See you then.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
