60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I don't like Option C because the station block's bin house smelled yucky! Option B sounds like a fun adventure, but Option A is like the next lane! Which one is the most fair?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I agree that Option C might be too expensive and difficult to maintain. Option A is simpler, but Option B seems the most fair since no one has to bear the burden alone.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A is a recipe for disaster; policing each other's timing will only fuel the fire. Option B is the only rational choice if we actually want to stop the resentment and start talking again.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you're so decisive! I'm with you on A; I can already see the ""trash police"" arguments starting. B is a bit of a hassle, but it's better than one person suffering forever. I vote B!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A and C both leave the burden on a single household, which is unacceptable. Option B is the only choice that ensures a truly equitable distribution of the physical and social burden. I vote B.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, @Asuka, @Shunichi! Everyone likes Option B! If we move the spot, it's like a traveling party for the trash! I vote for Option B too! It's the most fair and not yucky!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"It seems we've reached a wonderful consensus! Since everyone agrees that Option B is the most equitable and avoids the high costs of a structure, I'm happy to vote for Option B as well.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It's rare that we all agree on something so quickly. Since it's the only option that actually addresses the root of the tension without turning us into hall monitors, I'm in. I vote B.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,It's almost too easy! I'm glad we're all on the same page. Let's go with the traveling trash party then. I vote B!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,The consensus is clear. Option B is the only logical choice that addresses the physical disparity of our frontages and removes the unfair burden from a single household. I vote B.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! We all agree! I'm so happy we're doing the traveling trash party! It's going to be great! I vote B!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm so glad we could all agree on a solution that feels fair to everyone. It's a relief to know we're prioritizing harmony. I vote B!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Since the decision is already unanimous, there's no need to overthink it. Let's just hope this ""traveling party"" actually helps us get along. I vote B.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I'm just waiting for the official count now! It's a relief we aren't doing the paperwork for a permanent build. Let's keep this energy going! I vote B!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I have already cast my vote. Option B is the only arrangement that prevents a single household from being permanently disadvantaged. I stand by my decision. I vote B.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,Everything is decided! I'm so excited to see the trash move around! Let's make our neighborhood the cleanest and happiest one ever! I vote B!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm so happy we've found a way to be kind to one another. Let's work together to make this transition smooth and affordable for everyone. I vote B!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, the ""trash party"" it is. Let's just make sure the rotation schedule is clear so we don't find a new reason to stop speaking to each other. I vote B.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,"I'm with you, @Shunichi! A clear schedule is key so no one gets stuck doing all the heavy lifting. Let's make this work without the drama! I vote B!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"The result is unanimous. By rotating the location, we acknowledge the physical reality of our properties and ensure that no single resident is unfairly burdened. I vote B.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
